             correct target. A dedicated HTTP/3 fixture (infra/http3-server/) with quic-go
             v0.56.0 is required. Run the pipeline against hypogenie/http3-server:v0.56.0
             to obtain actual measurements. The enforcement gap is in http3/server.go
             readRequestHeader(). Fixed in v0.57.0. Post-cutoff.
